cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "array-signal-processing-lab: verified array processing, adaptive beamforming, pulse-Doppler processing and CFAR detection"
abstract: >-
  A Python study of narrowband uniform-linear-array processing, conventional
  and MVDR beamforming, finite-sample covariance effects, diagonal loading,
  steering mismatch, LFM pulse compression, range-Doppler processing and
  CA/OS-CFAR detection, with analytical and Monte Carlo verification.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Curtis
    given-names: Aaron
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-03
license: MIT
keywords:
  - array signal processing
  - adaptive beamforming
  - MVDR
  - radar signal processing
  - matched filter
  - CFAR
  - detection theory
